  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Congressional Budget Oversight Capacity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant will support and strengthen the technical capacities of the Peruvian Congress&#xb4; Budget Commission to increase its participation in all phases of the budgetary processcomma including the ex-post oversight through auditing and evaluation and the revision of the General Accounts of the Nation (Cuenta General de la Rep&#xfa;blica). In particularcomma it would support the Comisi&#xf3;n de Presupuesto y Cuentas Generales de la Rep&#xfa;blicacomma CPCGRcomma  (hereinafter the Budget Commission) in designing and implementing an information management system and in building its capacity to analyzecomma monitor and evaluate the budget in a non-partisancomma technically independentcomma and objective manner. This grant objective is the strengthening of the Peruvian Congress&apos; Budget Commission oversight capacity to monitor and evaluate the quality of the budget formulation and executioncomma and the revision of the General Accounts of the Republiccomma in a non-partisan and technically independent manner.  By improving the Congressional oversight capacitycomma the IDF would contribute to improve the quality and efficiency of public expenditures and to enhance representationcomma transparency and accountability of the public sector accountscomma and hence increase democratic governance.</narrative>
  </description>
